    "В тихие часы приложение не спрашивает результат выхода — соберёт утром одной карточкой." : {
      "comment" : "settings",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "During quiet hours the app doesn't ask how the outing went — it will gather everything into one card in the morning."
