    "Спасибо. Управлять ей можно в настройках App Store." : {
      "comment" : "body",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Thank you. You can manage it in App Store settings."
